{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>Only in the land of Goshen, where the children of Israel were</b> — Since He stretched out His hand toward the heavens and brought down the hail, it would have been fitting for it to fall also upon the land of Goshen, for its atmosphere and that of the land of Egypt are one. Therefore Scripture explained that the atmosphere of the land of Goshen was spared <b>because there were the children of Israel</b>."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:05:02.562066232Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}